        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This casual puzzle game features beautiful graphics that make up:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fanjing Mountain is located at the junction of Jiangkou, Yinjiang, and Songtao counties in Tongren City, Guizhou Province. It is situated at 27 ° 49 ′ 50 ″ -28 ° 1 ′ 30 ″ N latitude and 108 ° 45 ′ 55 ″ -108 ° 48 ′ 30 ″ E longitude, close to Jiangkou County, the southeast of Yinjiang County, and the southwest of Songtao County.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150260/extras/803128d341957465e107925eb3c287e6.avif?t=1763453022\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game starts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on 'start game', the image will be grayed out, and the colored parts will be randomly scrambled into 16 small fragments, scattered randomly on the screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game process:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players click on the small image, drag it to its original position to restore it, until all the small images move to the correct position, and the game ends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End or start the next game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the small fragments move to the correct position, and the game ends. At this point, click &quot;try again&quot; to repeat the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
